  0432:  addMinutesToDate 105 480
  0438:  advanceToDate 105
  043a:  warpTo GCAN09 2 255
  043e:  endSection
  0440:  speak 5 "Your wisdom, character and\nguts are what we need to\nsave this island.\n"
  04d2:  speak Player "What are you talking about?\n"
  0510:  speak 5 "I was testing you to see if\nyou are capable of saving us.\n"
  058a:  speak 5 "It's important to be\ngood in battle.\n"
  05da:  speak 5 "Besides power, courage and\nwisdom are also needed.\n"
  0646:  speak Player "Did we pass the test?\n"
  0678:  speak 5 "Yes, I'll help you\nas much as I can.\n"
  06c8:  speak Player "Will you come to the city?\nWhat will you do\nwith the shop?\n"
  0744:  speak 5 "I can open a shop later.\nThis shop's duty is done.\n"
